        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Alung hei pap #-5 jing sini,",
            "Thanmei bam tisu lou o;",
            "Alung khou hei he poubaumei,",
            "Tingsangjanga bam lou o.",
            "Nang bam ethei (2)",
            "Lung neilana bam ni e (2).",
            "",
            "2. Neikhat nang ta khiugiang suna,",
            "Neikhat nang khou lum louna;",
            "Man nimei khou lung gut lou rio,",
            "Ringsuangmei khou lung gut ro.",
            "Ti-ngam puni (2),",
            "Nangkhou lumlou rap khou#-5 (2).",
            "",
            "3. Bangmei preiriang sutap lou o,",
            "Abumang ta kan lou o;",
            "Jingmei khouhei bamsang lak khe,",
            "Neimik riu kum gan guang o.",
            "Gan bam ethei (2),",
            "Ai ningmei guangtang nithe (2)."
          ]
        }
      },
